From a0d42be97754ed378756f9941ac23ec259a24409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: janzon <jmmzon@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:28:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add live "sequoia:" wallpaper

A Sequoia scene renderer (src/shell/sequoia) that wallpaper and lock
surfaces draw through a new WallpaperSourceKind::Live. The scene eases
into motion when the session locks and, with desktop_motion = "still",
coasts to a stop after unlock; the settled frame is saved as a PNG for
the theme, greeter and backdrop. Settings live in [wallpaper.sequoia].

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
